    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 3:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ka dok walokke, wacito malo i yo ma dok i Bacan; ci Og kabaka me Bacan ocorre obino i komwa, en ki lwakke ducu, ka lweny i Edrei. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.3.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.3.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 3:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ento Rwot owacca ni, ‘Pe ilwore; pien atyeko miyo en ki lwakke ducu kacel ki lobone i ciŋi; ibitimo en macalo yam itimo i kom Cikon kabaka pa jo Amor, ma yam bedo i Kecbon.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.3.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.3.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 3:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kit meno Rwot Lubaŋawa omiyo Og kabaka me Bacan i ciŋwa bene, ki lwakke ducu; ci waloye, wanekogi nio ka danone mo pe odoŋ, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.3.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.3.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 3:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I kare meno wamako gaŋine madito ducu; pe tye gaŋ mo ma pe wamayo ki botgi, gaŋi pyerabicel kulu, i lobo me Argob ducu ma i te ker pa Og i Bacan. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.3.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.3.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 3:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lwak gaŋi man ducu onoŋo gigoyogi ki cel matek mutiŋŋe malo likuŋ, ma gitye ki doggaŋgi ma gicego ki rii, ma pe gikwano iye lwak gaŋi matitino mapol ma pe gicelogi ki cel. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.3.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.3.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 3:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wajwerogi woko liweŋ, macalo yam watimo i kom Cikon kabaka me Kecbon; wajwero gaŋi ducu, co wa ki mon ki litino. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.3.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.3.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 3:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ento lim makwo ducu ki jami ma wayako ki i gaŋi watero odoko mewa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.3.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.3.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 3:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kit meno i kare ca wakwanyo lobo meno ki i cin luker aryo pa jo Amor ma yam gitye loka Jordan, nia ki i nota me Amon nio wa i kom got Kermon. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.3.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.3.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 3:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "(Jo me Cidon gilwoo Kermon ni, Cirion, ento jo Amor gilwoŋo ni Cenir.) ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.3.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.3.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 3:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yam wamako gaŋi ducu ma i wi cere, kacel ki lobo Gilead ducu ki Bacan, nio kwede wa i Caleka ki Edrei, ma gin aye gaŋi ma i te ker pa Og i lobo Bacan. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.3.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.3.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 3:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "(Pien Og kabaka me Bacan en aye yam odoŋ kene ki i kin jo Repaim ma yam odoŋ, Nen, kitandane yam obedo ki tanda nyonyo; pud tye i Raba pa jo Ammon, Borre romo yadi aŋwen ki nucu ki lacce yadi aryo, ka gipimo ki yadi me nino ducu-ni.)",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.3.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.3.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 3:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.3.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.3.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 3:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“I kare meno, i kare ma wacamo lobo ma kenyo, amiyo lobo bot jo pa Reuben ki jo pa Gad, kun waŋe cakke ki i Aroer, ma i dog nota me Amon, kacel ki nucu lobo godi me Gilead ki gaŋi madito ducu ma tye iye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.3.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.3.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 3:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lobo Gilead mudoŋŋe, ki lobo Bacan ducu, en aye lobo Argob ducu, ma yam obedo i te ker pa Og, yam amiyo bot nucu kaka pa jo Manace. (Lobo Bacan meno ducu gilwoŋo ni lobo pa jo Repaim. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.3.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.3.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 3:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jair, ma jo Manace, yam otero lobo ducu me Argob, en aye Bacan, nio wa i waŋ apokki me lobo pa jo Gecur ki pa jo Maaka, ci ocako nyiŋ gaŋine ki nyiŋe kene ni Kavot-jair, macalo pud tye wa onyoo.) ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.3.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.3.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 3:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ci amiyo lobo Gilead bot Makir; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.3.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.3.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 3:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "‘ki bot jo pa Reuben ki jo pa Gad amiyo lobo ma a ki i Gilead cito kwede wa i nota me Amon, kun waŋ lobone obedo cwiny kulu, nio kwede wa i kulu Jabok, ma en aye waŋ lobo pa jo Ammon. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.3.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.3.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 3:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amiyogi Araba bene, ma Jordan aye waŋ apokkine, nia wa i nam me Kineret nio kwede i nam me Araba, en aye nam me Kado ma tye i pwor got me Piciga, ma tuŋ wokceŋ.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.3.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.3.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
