                "loc": "JOS.1.12+JOS.1.13+JOS.1.14+JOS.1.15"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Yoc 1.12-15",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Dok yam acikowu i kare meno kun awacci, ‘Rwot Lubaŋawu doŋ otyeko miyowu lobo man wucam obed mewu, Oteka lwenywu ducu myero gukat loka ca i nyim omegiwu jo Icrael kun noŋo guruko jami lwenygi; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.3.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.3.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 3:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ento monwu ki litinowu matino ki limwu makwo, (pien aŋeyo ni wutye ki lim madwoŋ), gin gibidoŋ i gaŋi madito ma doŋ amiyo botwu-ni, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.3.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.3.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 3:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nio ka Rwot doŋ omiyo omegiwu ka yweyo, kit ma omiyowu ka yweyo-ni, ma doŋ gin bene gucamo lobogi ma Rwot Lubaŋawu bimiyogi loka Jordan. Lacen wubidwogo, kun ŋat acel acel dwogo i dul lobone ma doŋ amiyowu-ni.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.3.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.3.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 3:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I kare meno bene yam aciko Yocwa ni, ‘In doŋ ityeko neno ki waŋi gin ducu ma Rwot Lubaŋawu otiyo i kom luker meno aryo-nu; Rwot dok bitimo kit meno i kom ker ducu ma wubio iye ka wukato loka ca, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.3.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.3.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 3:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Pe wulworgi, pien Rwot Lubaŋawu aye tye ka lwenyo piwu.’",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.3.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.3.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
